  id: saguarostamp
  title: 10. The Vehicle With Three Titles
  region: Docket 66
  briefing: Recover an illegally seized truck from corporate bounty crews. Break
    their interception waves, retrieve the title archive and return to the extraction
    point.
  opening: 'Rick: Absolutely clean title. Three of them, actually.|Johnny: Rick, that
    is the precise opposite of reassuring.'
  midpoint: 'Johnny: Every title routes debt to a company named Shade Optional Holdings.
    The same signature is on our original $173 work order.'
  closing: 'Rick: So the title is clean now?|Johnny: The title is evidence, Rick. Please
    stop laminating evidence.'
